{{!
    @template tool_vae/organisation_pathway

    The tables of the declared records of a pathway (a section each: its heading, its provenance, the note on bloc lines, its
    table), then the section of the records only a plan names, then the note that says the plans cannot be read. Nothing when
    there is neither. On logical lines: a comment carries each line break of the template, so that no space is drawn where
    the old code wrote none.

    Every text comes from the context, worded by tool_vae\output\organisation_pathway. The template holds no logic beyond its
    sections. Every text is escaped (double braces). Keys placed as they are (triple braces): headinghtml, the heading of the
    core; provenancehtml, drawn by tool_vae/provenance (or empty); tablehtml, drawn by tool_vae/table; courseshtml,
    activitieshtml and planshtml, drawn by tool_vae/organisation_cell.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * records - array, each {headinghtml, provenancehtml, blocnote, tablehtml}: blocnote null or {label}
    * planned - null, or {headinghtml, intro, items}: each item {code, name, courses, courseshtml, activities, activitieshtml,
      plans, planshtml}, name null or {label}
    * unreadable - null, or {label}: the note on plans that cannot be read

    Example context (json):
    {
        "records": [
            {
                "headinghtml": "<h3>RNCP100 — Assistant de vie aux familles</h3>",
                "provenancehtml": "<div class=\"small text-muted\">Source: France compétences.</div>",
                "blocnote": {"label": "A bloc line adds up the declarations of its competencies."},
                "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>RNCP100-C01</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
        ],
        "planned": {
            "headinghtml": "<h3>Records of your learning plans</h3>",
            "intro": "Your learning plans name these records.",
            "items": [
                {"code": "RS200", "name": {"label": "Utiliser un lève-personne"}, "courses": "Courses", "courseshtml": "none",
                    "activities": "Activities", "activitieshtml": "none", "plans": "Learning plans",
                    "planshtml": "Plan AES (Active)"}
            ]
        },
        "unreadable": {"label": "Your learning plans are not readable with your rights."}
    }
}}
{{#records}}<section class="tool-vae-organisation-record mb-4">{{{headinghtml}}}{{{provenancehtml}}}{{!
}}{{#blocnote}}<p class="small text-muted">{{label}}</p>{{/blocnote}}{{{tablehtml}}}</section>{{/records}}{{!
}}{{#planned}}<section class="tool-vae-organisation-planned mb-4">{{{headinghtml}}}<p>{{intro}}</p><ul>{{#items}}{{!
}}<li><strong>{{code}}</strong>{{#name}} — {{label}}{{/name}}<dl class="mb-2"><dt>{{courses}}</dt><dd>{{{courseshtml}}}</dd>{{!
}}<dt>{{activities}}</dt><dd>{{{activitieshtml}}}</dd><dt>{{plans}}</dt><dd>{{{planshtml}}}</dd></dl></li>{{/items}}</ul>{{!
}}</section>{{/planned}}{{!
}}{{#unreadable}}<p class="small text-muted">{{label}}</p>{{/unreadable}}
